183
00:23:29,088 --> 00:23:46,468
So the approach takes a H-infinity controller designed to maximize robustness and a linear quadratic Gaussian or LQG controller designed to maximize performance, and then it combines them in a particular structure that allows them to work together in a complementary way rather than enforcing a trade-off.

