00:32:11,568 --> 00:32:15,396
So much more work needs to be done there too.

256
00:32:16,576 --> 00:32:17,616
unobserved state.

257
00:32:17,696 --> 00:32:19,376
So this is what where we started.

258
00:32:19,616 --> 00:32:20,816
MDP framework.

259
00:32:21,454 --> 00:32:24,176
So MDP stands for Markov Decision Process.

