00:32:24,256 --> 00:32:28,356
And this is just the general problem setup to which reinforcement learning is applied.

261
00:32:29,550 --> 00:32:33,936
Are we relying too heavily on the assumption that somehow the state is observed?

262
00:32:34,126 --> 00:32:36,548
Of course, your whole history is the state.

263
00:32:37,038 --> 00:32:38,176
