00:34:07,726 --> 00:34:20,416
Adaptation online, as originally it was thought, or should it be used to create the basic algorithms that are running on board on a robot?

283
00:34:20,750 --> 00:34:22,335
So nature versus nurture.

284
00:34:22,766 --> 00:34:29,056
I think that you need both, but both are their own problems, and they need to work together.

